   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tonga Disaster Governance and Adaptive Capacity Strengthening Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tonga is one of the world&#x2019;s most exposed countries to natural hazards. The recent eruption of the Hunga Tonga-Hunga Ha&#x2019;apai volcano &#x2013; followed by a tsunami and more than 70 earthquakes (magnitudes 4.4-5.0) between 14 January and 04 February 2022 &#x2013; devastated the country and identified weaknesses in the emergency management system in Tonga. The compounding and cascading nature of hazards affecting Tonga poses a very different set of risks to its recovering economy and more broadly human developme</narrative>
  </description>
